      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Life of Jorge Luis Borges"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Mariano Llinás’ epic contemplation of the life and works of Jorge Luis Borges is every bit as wily and playful as the Argentine writer’s stories."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
