    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Moonglow"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The queen of sensual cinema returns with a 1970s Manila-set neo-noir about a police officer-turned-criminal under investigation by her former lover."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://d3cyv0xf0ss37v.cloudfront.net/2026/films/560x315/prince-01.jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "BFI London Film Festival 2026"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Prince"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The stakes are high for a prize-winning show dog, his owner, her butler and their extended family, in this kitsch comedy about avarice and love."
    }
